# Optional. CARTO raster PNG tiles now show an "API key required" watermark
# without this. The Chrome/Edge MapLibre view uses CARTO Dark Matter *vector*
# tiles, which currently work without a key. Carto still recommends requesting
# a free key at https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey and pasting it here.
# On Vercel, set the same name as a Production environment variable.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CARTO_API_KEY=

# Optional. Leave unset so the Next.js app serves /data and /api itself.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=

# Or point at any MapLibre style URL (MapTiler, OpenFreeMap, …).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_MAP_STYLE_URL=
